hecking our conditions, we see that\n\n- $f(3)=-1$ exists, $\\,\\,✓$\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to 3}f(x)$ does not exist $\\,\\,\\times $\n\nSo the second condition failed. It failed because the left and right-sided limits are not equal:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {3}^{-}}f(x)=-1,\\,\\,{lim}_{x\\to {3}^{+}}f(x)=3.\n$$\n\nThese limits both exist and are finite, yet they are not equal. Therefore, the discontinuity at $x=3$ is a jump discontinuity.\n\nConsequently, II is true, and I and III are false." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362520 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362521 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362522 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362523 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362524 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362524 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362519 1080 #uuid "c12ca190-d978-55a0-af55-963098af9ae7" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362520 1081 "II and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362520 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362520 1084 #uuid "b368f458-efb8-544f-9c52-9be536fdf394" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362521 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362521 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362521 1084 #uuid "c7d4fe7e-3216-55b5-9dfd-bcb24f8e9506" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362522 1081 "I only" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362522 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362522 1084 #uuid "15efd6a1-4757-5e0a-b81d-6837a9b8f7cc" 1319413953