7592186362737 1069 "q-1202" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362737 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362737 1071 "If $S={a,b}$, then $P(S)=$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362737 1072 #uuid "8210a2be-1390-5dba-95b7-c25b90c5d3ba" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362737 1074 "The power set of $S,$ denoted $P(S),$ is the set that contains every possible subset of $S,$ including the empty set $∅.$\n\nSo, let's list all possible subsets of $S$ using a tree diagram.\n\n![](images/c0/c02cab907b20d7c740c0f31d5474564eb24a43a9b89667d3a0093d8242597405.png)\n\nAccording to our diagram, the subsets of $S$ are\n\n$$\n∅={},\\,{a},\\,{b},\\,{a,b}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\nP(S)={∅,{a},{b},{a,b}}.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362739 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362740 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362741 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362742 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362743 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362740 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362738 1080 #uuid "b7cea7ac-2367-5e15-a6af-94f454d18628" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362739 1081 "{∅,{a},{b}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362739 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362739 1084 #uuid "a9f04ba3-a4a3-590c-bdea-30fd4ffaf53b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362740 1081 "{∅,{a},{b},{a,b}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362740 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362740 1084 #uuid "62d4f445-9d39-5d97-925e-302bbdbc1da1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362741 1081 "{{a},{b},{a,b}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362741 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362741 1084 #uuid "ddec2d14-8b5f-51e7-b751-4a0869f6d233" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362742 1081 "{∅,{a,b}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362742 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362742 1084 #uuid "71077529-9a68-565f-a776-a2b09a46b615" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362743 1081 "{∅,{{a,b}}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362743 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362743 1084 #uuid "132bd570-7d40-54cc-96a7-26f05ee1b4fc" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362744 1068 #edb/ref 17592186362745 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362744 1069 "q-120985" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362744 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362744 1071 "A particle $P$ moves along the $x$-axis and its velocity at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=3{t}^{2}-4t.$ What is the total displacement of the particle between $t=2$ and $t=4?$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362744 1072 #uuid "9ad7b73f-fb25-5c31-b21a-d356762f91d2" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362744 1074 "We find the total displacement by calculating the definite integral of the velocity.\n\nLet $d$ be the total displacement. Then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & ={\\int }_{2}^{4}(3{t}^{2}-4t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={({t}^{3}-2{t}^{2})|}_{2}^{4} \\\\  & =[(4)^{3}-2(4)^{2}]-[(2)^{3}-2(2)^{2}] \\\\  & =[64-32]-[8-8] \\\\  & =32.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo the total displacement between $t=2$ and $t=4$ is $32.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362745 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362746 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362745 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362747 13194139