db/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362751 1071 "A particle $P$ moves along the $x$-axis and its velocity at time $t$ is given by $v(t)=2t-\\sqrt{t}.$ What is the total displacement of the particle between $t=0$ and $t=9?$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362751 1072 #uuid "261770c7-7955-5658-985f-a98194f9a404" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362751 1074 "We find the total displacement by calculating the definite integral of the velocity.\n\nLet $d$ be the total displacement. Then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & ={\\int }_{0}^{9}(2t-\\sqrt{t})\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={({t}^{2}-\\frac{2}{3}{t}^{3/2})|}_{0}^{9} \\\\  & =[(9)^{2}-\\frac{2}{3}(9)^{3/2}]-[(0)^{2}-\\frac{2}{3}(0)^{3/2}] \\\\  & =81-18-0 \\\\  & =63.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the total displacement between $t=0$ and $t=9$ is $63.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362753 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362754 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362755 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362756 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362757 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362757 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362752 1080 #uuid "3b841300-5c7d-509b-8ab7-625e31f6a516" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362753 1081 "36" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362753 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362753 1084 #uuid "10153938-e8ec-5c96-b3c4-f24b6f2c9e3a" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362754 1081 "81" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362754 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17