 the level curves for the function $f(x,y)$ are given by the equation\n\n$$\nf(x,y)=c.\n$$\n\nIn our case, we're interested in $c=1.$ So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =c \\\\ \\frac{x}{2{y}^{2}+1} & =1 \\\\ x & =2{y}^{2}+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the level curve that passes through $P(3,-1)$ is the parabola $x=2{y}^{2}+1.$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362849 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362850 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362851 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362852 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362853 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362850 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362848 1080 #uuid "4491bbbe-7549-50e8-ad8a-aca200ce17e3" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362849 1081 "x=1-y" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362849 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362849 1084 #uuid "995200e2-5e10-52e1-90be-fc815f544450" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362850 1081 "x=2{y}^{2}+1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362850 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362850 1084 #uuid "ae5d37a2-e3f4-52f8-88c7-9baa4e8494ec" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362851 1081 "x={y}^{2}-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362851 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362851 1084 #uuid "09235770-a24c-5100-9f0f-3f63222ce061" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1081 "x=2y-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362852 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 1319413953344