 $y=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (0,0)\\,\\,\\,y=0}\\frac{{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{x}^{2}-{0}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{0}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}1 \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Taking $x\\to (0,0)$ along the path $y=x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to (0,0)\\,\\,\\,y=x}\\frac{{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{{x}^{2}-{x}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{x}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}\\frac{0}{2{x}^{2}} \\\\  & ={lim}_{x\\to 0}0 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBecause the limit evaluates to different results on two different paths, we conclude that the limit does not exist:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to (0,0)}\\frac{{x}^{2}-{y}^{2}}{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}}=\\text{DNE}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362926 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362927 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362928 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362929 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1075 #edb/ref 17592186362930 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1079 #edb/ref 17592186362928 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362925 1080 #uuid "f471c6a4-8548-5953-bc64-722a32227684" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362926 1081 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362926 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362926 1084 #uuid "ed9a8298-54cd-5904-87cc-0773ceed9484" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362927 1081 "1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362927 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186362927 1084 #uuid "16292b9f-eddf