 17592186045585 true] [17592186363648 1074 "Using the formula for the scalar projection, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,m & =|\\,m\\,|\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =12cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =12\\cdot \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\  & =6\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363649 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363650 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363649 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363649 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363649 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363650 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363649 1080 #uuid "569ff198-8871-5c1e-bb50-e29a59fe2e29" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363650 1081 "6\\sqrt{2}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363650 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363650 1084 #uuid "58363d5c-920b-5c26-a09f-feadb48d18af" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363651 1068 #edb/ref 17592186363652 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363651 1069 "q-318978" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363651 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363651 1071 "Let $r=⟨-3,2,4⟩$ and $s=⟨1,2,-1⟩.$ Find the scalar projection of $r$ onto $s.$\n\n${\\text{comp}}_{s}\\,r=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363651 1072 #uuid "2aae90e0-11e3-5ee4-8f7d-d33e1592b8e6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363651 1074 "Using the scalar projection formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{comp}}_{s}\\,r & =\\frac{r\\cdot s}{|\\,s\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{r}_{x}{s}_{x}+{r}_{y}{s}_{y}+{r}_{z}{s}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{s}_{x}^{2}+{s}_{y}^{2}+{s}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-3)(1)+(2)(2)+(4)(-1)}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-1)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-3+4-4}{\\sqrt{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [1759