ally, since $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\pi )=(-1)^{n},$ we have\n\n$$\n{b}_{n}=\\frac{6(1-(-1)^{n})}{\\pi n}.\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363865 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363866 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363867 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363868 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1075 #edb/ref 17592186363869 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045494 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1077 "field-1" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1079 #edb/ref 17592186363869 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363864 1080 #uuid "acddc9da-f416-502b-a8b1-7e3b25bc89e5" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363865 1081 "\\frac{6(1+(-1)^{n})}{\\pi n}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363865 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363865 1084 #uuid "c1ba050f-0e34-5d8c-83aa-f3242fc48a77" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363866 1081 "\\frac{(1-(-1)^{n})}{6\\pi n}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363866 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363866 1084 #uuid "995e1ab4-b124-5ed9-856a-c8dd7f49f2af" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363867 1081 "\\frac{3(1-(-1)^{n})}{\\pi n}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363867 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363867 1084 #uuid "b876efa2-19b0-53d0-8e5f-5f77d454f201" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363868 1081 "\\frac{3(1+(-1)^{n})}{\\pi n}" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363868 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363868 1084 #uuid "2641e9c0-dea9-5f20-8423-8964d19b533f" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186363869 1081 "\\frac