 equations \n\n$$\nf(x,y)=c.\n$$\n\nNotice that the range of $f(x,y)$ is $[0,\\infty ).$ So, we will consider only level curves for $c\\ge 0.$\n\nTherefore, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =c \\\\ \\sqrt{3{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2}} & =c \\\\ 3{x}^{2}+2{y}^{2} & ={c}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation above gives us a family of ellipses centered at the origin. Therefore, the correct graph is as follows:\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\n![](images/cc/cccaa6d7f554076b3a79364e1f2c4c061ae7cd86f7f0064e3861ba3b035b6a3e.png)" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364200 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364201 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364202 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364203 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364204 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364201 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364199 1080 #uuid "15955093-e5c1-50f6-b2be-d700cd4f9e99" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364200 1081 "images/65/6521da99a82e38a68a5aa87a0c7c88eacf4ed7b78351af594ec309fa2cb7f57b.png" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364200 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364200 1084 #uuid "8f17d518-60b8-544c-92f5-2cf0aab0557b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1081 "images/cc/cccaa6d7f554076b3a79364e1f2c4c061ae7cd86f7f0064e3861ba3b035b6a3e.png" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364201 1084 #uuid "6196a8f6-ab71-5465-a24f-af55f550e44b" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364202 1081 "images/7c/7c4530dc74747fc0bdae0ca4c8608a72dbf03ca413d