6978-4954-5e32-8970-39309434a5d8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364413 1074 "Consider the standard basis ${i,j}$ of the Euclidean plane ${R}^{2}$ and the unit square spanned by the vectors, as shown below. \n\n![](images/9e/9e322e6ed1ddb8f1d094633e931cd179b7eb9d6f47acd7c7d0809f113df91b22.png)\n\nNow, we compute the images of ${i,j}$ under $T$, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{i}^{′} & =T(i)=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]=-i \\\\ {j}^{′} & =T(j)=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]=j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, we obtain the following image:\n\n![](images/86/86adc8f8f32a097b0506adbe15da962e34aad904bf603714bac5cd27712095c8.png)\n\nTherefore, the matrix represents a reflection across the $y$-axis." 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364415 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364416 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364417 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364418 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364419 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364419 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364414 1080 #uuid "c90e3369-4144-5c6b-8d5a-8ffbc0479b3d" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364415 1081 "Reflection across the $x$-axis" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364415 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364415 1084 #uuid "e1f5bb9f-4135-5c93-aeba-435234089c0e" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364416 1081 "Dilatio