l.\"\n\nNow, we simplify the phrase \"the actor is successful and the actor is successful\" to just \"the actor is successful.\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"The actor is talented, and the actor is successful.\"\n\nFinally, we simplify the sentence to\n\n\"The actor is talented and successful.\"" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364539 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364540 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364541 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364542 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364543 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364543 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364538 1080 #uuid "abb97ba1-9dda-568d-8499-4d801e4f661c" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364539 1081 "The actor is talented or successful" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364539 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364539 1084 #uuid "cfe5cf7b-34eb-579b-9de5-66399500f2a6" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364540 1081 "The actor is talented" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364540 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364540 1084 #uuid "30244b4c-438e-5366-9917-43241c71cfc8" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364541 1081 "The actor is talented but not successful" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364541 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364541 1084 #uuid "b3a60427-f52c-5b3a-ae20-3a29782bff43" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364542 1081 "The actor is successful" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364542 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364542 1084 #uuid "e604e0e4-76fa-58b1-8eb9-2a0132713d34" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364543 1081 "The actor is talented and successful" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364543 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364543 1084 #uuid "3723d2e4-7af5-507a-8e12-579bed0e2c54" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364544 1068 #edb/ref 17592186364545 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364544 1069 "q-89267" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364544 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364544 1071 "Simplify $(Y∧Y)∨(Y∨X).$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364544 1072 #uuid "4012a3f8-c7ce-5fed-b187-a6f559d5a277" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364544 1074 "Using the associative and idempotent laws, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(Y∧Y)∨(Y∨X) & ≡Y∨(Y∨X) \\\\  & ≡(Y∨Y)∨X \\\\  & ≡Y∨X.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364546 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364547 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364548 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364549 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1075 #edb/ref 17592186364550 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1077 "selection" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1079 #edb/ref 17592186364547 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364545 1080 #uuid "28ad66dc-0d3e-5c4c-b316-663c6b72c693" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364546 1081 "X" 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364546 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533445 17592186045585 true] [17592186364546 1084 #uuid "7d1514f1-db85-5097-b119-2e4f652c7